.print-only{display:block!important}
.hide-for-print{display:none!important}
.show-for-print{display:inherit!important}}
@media amzn-kf8,print{#header>h1:first-child{margin-top:1.25rem}
.sect1{padding:0!important}
.sect1+.sect1{border:0}
#footer{background:none}
#footer-text{color:rgba(0,0,0,.6);font-size:.9em}}
@media amzn-kf8{#header,#content,#footnotes,#footer{padding:0}}
</style>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css">
</head>
<body class="article toc2 toc-right">
<div id="header">
<h1>Common API</h1>
<div id="toc" class="toc2">
<div id="toctitle">Table of Contents</div>
<ul class="sectlevel1">
<li><a href="#usage">Usage</a></li>
<li><a href="#functions">Functions</a>
<ul class="sectlevel2">
<li><a href="#getcontentbranch">getContentBranch</a></li>
<li><a href="#getlocalemapping">getLocaleMapping</a></li>
<li><a href="#getlocalemappingbylocale">getLocaleMappingByLocale</a></li>
<li><a href="#getlocalemappingbyprojectid">getLocaleMappingByProjectId</a></li>
<li><a href="#getrequestlocaleinfo">getRequestLocaleInfo</a></li>
<li><a href="#localizemappings">localizeMappings</a></li>
<li><a href="#encryptparams">encryptParams</a></li>
<li><a href="#decryptparams">decryptParams</a></li>
<li><a href="#imageurlquery">imageUrlQuery</a></li>
<li><a href="#mediaurlquery">mediaUrlQuery</a></li>
<li><a href="#attachmenturlquery">attachmentUrlQuery</a></li>
<li><a href="#pageurlquery">pageUrlQuery</a></li>
<li><a href="#imageurl">imageUrl</a></li>
<li><a href="#mediaurl">mediaUrl</a></li>
<li><a href="#attachmenturl">attachmentUrl</a></li>
<li><a href="#pageurl">pageUrl</a></li>
<li><a href="#richtextquery">richTextQuery</a></li>
<li><a href="#richtextfragments">richTextFragments</a></li>
<li><a href="#withrichtextfragments">withRichTextFragments</a></li>
<li><a href="#sanitizegraphqlname">sanitizeGraphqlName</a></li>
<li><a href="#validatedata">validateData</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="#classes">Classes</a>
<ul class="sectlevel2">
<li><a href="#componentregistry">ComponentRegistry</a></li>
<li><a href="#i18n">I18n</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="#type_definitions">Type Definitions</a>
<ul class="sectlevel2">
<li><a href="#context">Context</a></li>
<li><a href="#locale-mapping">LocaleMapping</a></li>
<li><a href="#component-definition-params">ComponentDefinitionParams</a></li>
<li><a href="#global-variables">GlobalVariables</a></li>
<li><a href="#url-mapping-rule">UrlMappingRule</a></li>
<li><a href="#image-url">ImageUrl</a></li>
<li><a href="#attachment-url">AttachmentUrl</a></li>
<li><a href="#page-url">PageUrl</a></li>
<li><a href="#media-url-meta">MediaUrlMeta</a></li>
<li><a href="#media-url-args">MediaUrlArgs</a></li>
<li><a href="#meta-data">MetaData</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><a href="#constants">Constants</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div id="content">
<div id="preamble">
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Exports from <code>@enonic/nextjs-adapter</code> may be used in shared code unless their behavior requires a server-only Next.js API.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="usage"><a class="link" href="#usage">Usage</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-TypeScript" data-lang="TypeScript">import {
    ComponentRegistry,
    getLocaleMapping,
    I18n,
    imageUrl,
    imageUrlQuery,
    validateData
} from '@enonic/nextjs-adapter';</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="functions"><a class="link" href="#functions">Functions</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="getcontentbranch"><a class="link" href="#getcontentbranch">getContentBranch</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the XP branch for a request context: <code>master</code> for direct Next.js and <code>live</code> requests, <code>draft</code> for editing contexts.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>getContentBranch()</code> takes an optional <a href="#context">Context</a> object. Without it, the branch follows the <code>RENDER_MODE</code> environment variable, defaulting to <code>master</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code> — <code>master</code> or <code>draft</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="getlocalemapping"><a class="link" href="#getlocalemapping">getLocaleMapping</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Resolves the locale, project, and site mapping for a request. The Content Studio project header takes precedence over the route locale.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>getLocaleMapping()</code> takes a single <a href="#context">Context</a> object.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>LocaleMapping</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="getlocalemappingbylocale"><a class="link" href="#getlocalemappingbylocale">getLocaleMappingByLocale</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the mapping for <code>locale</code>. The optional <code>useDefault</code> boolean defaults to <code>true</code> and controls fallback to the default mapping.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>locale</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Locale to find.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>useDefault</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>boolean</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Fall back to the default mapping. Default: <code>true</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>LocaleMapping</code> or <code>undefined</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="getlocalemappingbyprojectid"><a class="link" href="#getlocalemappingbyprojectid">getLocaleMappingByProjectId</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the mapping for an XP project ID. Matching is case-insensitive; <code>useDefault</code> defaults to <code>true</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>projectId</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> XP project ID to find.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>useDefault</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>boolean</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Fall back to the default mapping. Default: <code>true</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>LocaleMapping</code> or <code>undefined</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="getrequestlocaleinfo"><a class="link" href="#getrequestlocaleinfo">getRequestLocaleInfo</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns <code>{locale, locales, defaultLocale}</code> for a request context. The project header is used in Content Studio; otherwise the route locale or default locale is used.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>getRequestLocaleInfo()</code> takes a single <a href="#context">Context</a> object.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>An object containing the selected <code>locale</code>, all configured <code>locales</code>, and <code>defaultLocale</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="localizemappings"><a class="link" href="#localizemappings">localizeMappings</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Prefixes the targets of URL mapping rules with a locale, for the <code>/api/mappings</code> response. Targets of the default mapping are returned unchanged, because default-locale URLs carry no prefix. Sources stay site-relative.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>mappings</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#url-mapping-rule">UrlMappingRule</a>`[]`</p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Rules to localize.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>mapping</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>{locale, default}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Locale mapping of the project, normally from <code>getLocaleMappingByProjectId()</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><a href="#url-mapping-rule">UrlMappingRule</a>`[]`.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Example</p>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-TypeScript" data-lang="TypeScript">const MAPPINGS: UrlMappingRule[] = [
    {sources: ['/.*'], target: '/${siteRelativePath}'}
];

return NextResponse.json({mappings: localizeMappings(MAPPINGS, mapping)});</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="encryptparams"><a class="link" href="#encryptparams">encryptParams</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Encrypts a JSON-serializable object with AES-256-GCM, using the SHA-256 hash of <code>secret</code> as the key. The result is the <code>xp</code> blob format the Next.XP app sends. Requires Node.js <code>crypto</code>, so call it only from server code.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>params</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>Record&lt;string, any&gt;</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Values to encrypt.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>secret</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Shared secret, normally <code>ENONIC_API_TOKEN</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code> — base64url-encoded IV, ciphertext, and authentication tag.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="decryptparams"><a class="link" href="#decryptparams">decryptParams</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Decrypts an <code>xp</code> blob produced by the Next.XP app or <code>encryptParams()</code>. Successful decryption proves that the sender knows the shared secret. Requires Node.js <code>crypto</code>, so call it only from server code.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>blob</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Value of the <code>xp</code> parameter.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>secret</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Shared secret, normally <code>ENONIC_API_TOKEN</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>Record&lt;string, any&gt;</code> with the decrypted values, such as <code>xpProject</code>, or <code>null</code> when the blob is invalid or was encrypted with another secret.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="imageurlquery"><a class="link" href="#imageurlquery">imageUrlQuery</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the Guillotine selection for an image URL: <code>imageUrl(&lt;args&gt;)</code> with every field of the <a href="#image-url">ImageUrl</a> type. Use it inside a <code>&#8230;&#8203; on media_Image</code> selection.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>imageUrlQuery()</code> takes an optional <code>args</code> object with these properties:</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>scale</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Image scale, for example <code>width(500)</code> or <code>block(100,100)</code>. Omit to use Guillotine&#8217;s default.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>quality</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>number</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> JPEG quality.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>background</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Background color for transparent images.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>format</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Output format, for example <code>webp</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>filter</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Image filter.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Example</p>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-TypeScript" data-lang="TypeScript">`... on media_Image { ${imageUrlQuery({scale: 'width(500)'})} }`</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="mediaurlquery"><a class="link" href="#mediaurlquery">mediaUrlQuery</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the Guillotine selection <code>mediaUrl(&lt;args&gt;)</code> with every field of the <a href="#attachment-url">AttachmentUrl</a> type.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>mediaUrlQuery()</code> takes an optional <a href="#media-url-args">MediaUrlArgs</a> object.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="attachmenturlquery"><a class="link" href="#attachmenturlquery">attachmentUrlQuery</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the Guillotine selection <code>attachmentUrl(&lt;args&gt;)</code> with every field of the <a href="#attachment-url">AttachmentUrl</a> type.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>attachmentUrlQuery()</code> takes an optional <a href="#media-url-args">MediaUrlArgs</a> object.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="pageurlquery"><a class="link" href="#pageurlquery">pageUrlQuery</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the Guillotine selection <code>pageUrl(&lt;args&gt;) { baseUrl path queryString }</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>pageUrlQuery()</code> takes an optional <code>args</code> object with these properties:</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>params</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Extra query parameters added to the URL.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="imageurl"><a class="link" href="#imageurl">imageUrl</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Builds an image URL from the result of <code>imageUrlQuery()</code>. For <code>meta.branch === 'draft'</code>, it appends the media endpoint path and query string to <code>/api/media</code>. For published content, it uses the media base URL (<code>ENONIC_MEDIA_CDN</code>, default <code>ENONIC_API</code>). See <a href="../nextjs/rich-text.ahtml#media-proxy">Draft media proxy</a>. Resolve the URL on the server and pass it to client components so the environment configuration stays server-side.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>data</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#image-url">ImageUrl</a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>URL object from Guillotine. Only <code>path</code> is required; <code>queryString</code> is optional. May be <code>null</code> or <code>undefined</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>meta</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#media-url-meta">MediaUrlMeta</a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Branch context, usually the page&#8217;s <a href="#meta-data">MetaData</a>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>, or <code>undefined</code> when <code>data</code> is empty.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="mediaurl"><a class="link" href="#mediaurl">mediaUrl</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Builds a draft-proxy or published media URL from the result of <code>mediaUrlQuery()</code>, in the same way as <code>imageUrl()</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>data</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#attachment-url">AttachmentUrl</a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>URL object from Guillotine. Only <code>path</code> is required; <code>queryString</code> is optional. May be <code>null</code> or <code>undefined</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>meta</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#media-url-meta">MediaUrlMeta</a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Branch context, usually the page&#8217;s <a href="#meta-data">MetaData</a>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>, or <code>undefined</code> when <code>data</code> is empty.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="attachmenturl"><a class="link" href="#attachmenturl">attachmentUrl</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Builds a draft-proxy or published attachment URL from the result of <code>attachmentUrlQuery()</code>, in the same way as <code>imageUrl()</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>data</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#attachment-url">AttachmentUrl</a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>URL object from Guillotine. Only <code>path</code> is required; <code>queryString</code> is optional. May be <code>null</code> or <code>undefined</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>meta</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#media-url-meta">MediaUrlMeta</a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Branch context, usually the page&#8217;s <a href="#meta-data">MetaData</a>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>, or <code>undefined</code> when <code>data</code> is empty.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="pageurl"><a class="link" href="#pageurl">pageUrl</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Builds a relative Next.js URL from the result of <code>pageUrlQuery()</code>. The site-relative <code>path</code> is prefixed with <code>meta.locale</code> unless it equals <code>meta.defaultLocale</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>data</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><a href="#page-url">PageUrl</a></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>URL object from Guillotine. Only <code>path</code> is required, so <code>{path: '/'}</code> gives the site root. May be <code>null</code> or <code>undefined</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>meta</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>{locale, defaultLocale}</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Usually the page&#8217;s <a href="#meta-data">MetaData</a>. Without <code>defaultLocale</code>, the locale prefix is always added, which gives the internal <code>/[locale]</code> route path.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>, or <code>undefined</code> when <code>data</code> is empty.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Example</p>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-tsx" data-lang="tsx">&lt;Link href={pageUrl(parent.pageUrl, meta)}&gt;Back&lt;/Link&gt;
&lt;Link href={pageUrl({path: '/'}, meta)}&gt;Home&lt;/Link&gt;</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="richtextquery"><a class="link" href="#richtextquery">richTextQuery</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the selection for a rich-text field, including processed HTML and structured references for images, links, and registered macros. <code>fetchGuillotine()</code> appends the required fragment definitions automatically.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>fieldName</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Name of the rich-text field in the content or component schema.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>options</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>object</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Image settings listed below.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>The optional <code>options</code> object has these properties:</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>imageWidths</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>number[]</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Responsive image widths. Default: <code>[400, 800, 1200]</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>imageSizes</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> HTML sizes expression. Default: <code>(max-width: 400px) 400px, (max-width: 800px) 800px, 1200px</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>imageSrcWidth</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>number</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Primary image width. Omitted by default, leaving Guillotine&#8217;s default in effect.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Example</p>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-TypeScript" data-lang="TypeScript">const bodySelection = richTextQuery('body', {imageWidths: [640, 1280]});</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="richtextfragments"><a class="link" href="#richtextfragments">richTextFragments</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the GraphQL fragment definitions spread by <code>richTextQuery()</code>, including the registered macros. <code>fetchGuillotine()</code> appends them automatically; use this function for queries sent through another client.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="withrichtextfragments"><a class="link" href="#withrichtextfragments">withRichTextFragments</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Appends the rich-text fragment definitions a query spreads but does not define.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>query</code> (<code>string</code>) — GraphQL document.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="sanitizegraphqlname"><a class="link" href="#sanitizegraphqlname">sanitizeGraphqlName</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Converts text into a valid GraphQL name by replacing unsupported characters and prefixing names that begin with a number.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>text</code> (<code>string</code>) — value to sanitize.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>string</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="validatedata"><a class="link" href="#validatedata">validateData</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Validates a <code>FetchContentResult</code>. Missing content invokes Next.js not-found handling; XP shortcuts invoke redirect handling.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Parameters</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>props</code> (<code>FetchContentResult</code>) — result returned by <code>fetchContent()</code>.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph lead">
<p>Returns</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p><code>void</code>. The function may invoke Next.js navigation handling.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="classes"><a class="link" href="#classes">Classes</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="componentregistry"><a class="link" href="#componentregistry">ComponentRegistry</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Static registry connecting XP descriptors to queries, processors, and React views.</p>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="addcontenttype"><a class="link" href="#addcontenttype">addContentType</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Registers a content-type mapping by application-qualified name.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="addpage"><a class="link" href="#addpage">addPage</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Registers an XP page descriptor.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="addlayout"><a class="link" href="#addlayout">addLayout</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Registers an XP layout descriptor.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="addpart"><a class="link" href="#addpart">addPart</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Registers an XP part descriptor.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="addmacro"><a class="link" href="#addmacro">addMacro</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Registers an XP macro descriptor.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="addcomponent"><a class="link" href="#addcomponent">addComponent</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Registers a generic component kind such as the built-in <code>part</code>, <code>layout</code>, or <code>text</code> handling.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Each registration method accepts a name and a <code>ComponentDefinitionParams</code> object. Repeated registration merges properties for the same name.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="setcommonquery"><a class="link" href="#setcommonquery">setCommonQuery</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Sets the query whose processed result is returned as <code>common</code> for every render.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getcommonquery"><a class="link" href="#getcommonquery">getCommonQuery</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the registered shared query.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getbycomponent"><a class="link" href="#getbycomponent">getByComponent</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Resolves the definition for a normalized <code>PageComponent</code> from its type and descriptor.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getcontenttype"><a class="link" href="#getcontenttype">getContentType</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns a content-type definition by name, falling back to <code>CATCH_ALL</code> when registered.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getpage"><a class="link" href="#getpage">getPage</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns a page definition by descriptor, with catch-all fallback.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getlayout"><a class="link" href="#getlayout">getLayout</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns a layout definition by descriptor, with catch-all fallback.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getpart"><a class="link" href="#getpart">getPart</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns a part definition by descriptor, with catch-all fallback.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getmacro"><a class="link" href="#getmacro">getMacro</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns a macro definition by descriptor, with catch-all fallback.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getcomponent"><a class="link" href="#getcomponent">getComponent</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns a generic component-kind definition, with catch-all fallback.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getcontenttypes"><a class="link" href="#getcontenttypes">getContentTypes</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns all explicitly registered content-type definitions as name-definition pairs.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getpages"><a class="link" href="#getpages">getPages</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns all explicitly registered page definitions.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getlayouts"><a class="link" href="#getlayouts">getLayouts</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns all explicitly registered layout definitions.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getparts"><a class="link" href="#getparts">getParts</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns all explicitly registered part definitions.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getmacros"><a class="link" href="#getmacros">getMacros</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns all explicitly registered macro definitions.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getcomponents"><a class="link" href="#getcomponents">getComponents</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns all explicitly registered generic component definitions.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="i18n"><a class="link" href="#i18n">I18n</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Static localization helper for server-rendered front-end phrases.</p>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="setlocale"><a class="link" href="#setlocale">setLocale</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Loads <code>@phrases/&lt;locale&gt;.json</code> and returns its dictionary.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="localize"><a class="link" href="#localize">localize</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the phrase for a key and substitutes positional <code>{}</code> or indexed <code>{0}</code> placeholders. A missing phrase is returned as <code>&lt;key&gt;</code>.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getlocale"><a class="link" href="#getlocale">getLocale</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the active locale.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect3">
<h4 id="getdictionary"><a class="link" href="#getdictionary">getDictionary</a></h4>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Returns the loaded phrase dictionary.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="type_definitions"><a class="link" href="#type_definitions">Type Definitions</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="context"><a class="link" href="#context">Context</a></h3>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>contentPath</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code> or <code>string[]</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Site-relative path requested from XP.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>headers</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>Headers</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Request headers.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>locale</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Active front-end locale.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="locale-mapping"><a class="link" href="#locale-mapping">LocaleMapping</a></h3>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>default</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>boolean</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Whether this is the fallback mapping.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>project</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>XP project ID.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>site</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Site path inside the project.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>locale</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Front-end locale.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="component-definition-params"><a class="link" href="#component-definition-params">ComponentDefinitionParams</a></h3>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>query</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>SelectedQueryMaybeVariablesFunc</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Guillotine query and optional variables function.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>configQuery</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Query selection for component configuration.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>processor</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>DataProcessor</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Asynchronous data transformation.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>view</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>React.FunctionComponent</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> React renderer.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="global-variables"><a class="link" href="#global-variables">GlobalVariables</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Variables the adapter supplies to every registered query. A variables function must return them, optionally with additional variables.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>path</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Full XP content path, including the site.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>scopeKey</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Site path from the locale mapping.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>project</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>XP project from the locale mapping.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>branch</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><code>draft</code> in draft mode, otherwise <code>master</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="url-mapping-rule"><a class="link" href="#url-mapping-rule">UrlMappingRule</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>One rule of the <code>/api/mappings</code> response.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>sources</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string[]</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Conditions a content item must meet. A <code>field:value</code> entry compares a content field, for example <code>type:portal:site</code>; any other entry is a regular expression matched against the item&#8217;s site-relative path.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>target</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Next.js URL template. <code>${siteRelativePath}</code> is replaced by the item&#8217;s site-relative path; other <code>${field}</code> placeholders are replaced by content field values.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>matchAny</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>boolean</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Match when any source matches instead of all. Default: <code>false</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="image-url"><a class="link" href="#image-url">ImageUrl</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Result of <code>imageUrlQuery()</code>.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>path</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Full media API path with a leading slash.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>queryString</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>URL-escaped query string with a <code>?</code> prefix.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>context</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Project context segment.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>id</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Content ID.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>fingerprint</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Media fingerprint.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>scale</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Processed scale segment.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>name</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>File name, with the requested format extension.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="attachment-url"><a class="link" href="#attachment-url">AttachmentUrl</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Result of <code>mediaUrlQuery()</code> and <code>attachmentUrlQuery()</code>. It has the <code>path</code>, <code>queryString</code>, <code>context</code>, <code>id</code>, <code>fingerprint</code>, and <code>name</code> fields of <a href="#image-url">ImageUrl</a>, plus:</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>intent</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><code>download</code> or <code>inline</code>.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="page-url"><a class="link" href="#page-url">PageUrl</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Result of <code>pageUrlQuery()</code>.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>baseUrl</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Base URL resolved by XP. The adapter&#8217;s <code>pageUrl()</code> uses the path and locale to construct the Next.js URL instead.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>path</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>Site-relative content path.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>queryString</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p>URL-escaped query string.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="media-url-meta"><a class="link" href="#media-url-meta">MediaUrlMeta</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Branch context shared by <code>imageUrl()</code>, <code>mediaUrl()</code>, and <code>attachmentUrl()</code>.</p>
</div>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>branch</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>string</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><code>draft</code> selects the <code>/api/media</code> proxy. Published content uses <code>master</code> and the configured API or CDN media base URL.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="media-url-args"><a class="link" href="#media-url-args">MediaUrlArgs</a></h3>
<table class="tableblock frame-none grid-none stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 1%;">
<col style="width: 98%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Name</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Type</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Description</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>download</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>boolean</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><div class="content"><div class="paragraph">
<p><strong>Optional.</strong> Serve the file as a download.</p>
</div></div></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div class="sect2">
<h3 id="meta-data"><a class="link" href="#meta-data">MetaData</a></h3>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Runtime information returned by <code>fetchContent()</code>: content identity and path, project, site, branch, XP base URL, locale, render mode, request type, renderability, and requested component.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sect1">
<h2 id="constants"><a class="link" href="#constants">Constants</a></h2>
<div class="sectionbody">
<table class="tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch">
<colgroup>
<col style="width: 25%;">
<col style="width: 75%;">
</colgroup>
<thead>
<tr>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Export</th>
<th class="tableblock halign-left valign-top">Purpose</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>APP_NAME</code>, <code>APP_NAME_DASHED</code>, <code>APP_NAME_UNDERSCORED</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Application key from the environment and descriptor-safe variants.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>IS_DEV_MODE</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Whether <code>NODE_ENV</code> is <code>development</code>, as under <code>next dev</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>CATCH_ALL</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Registry key for a fallback definition.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>RENDER_MODE</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Direct, edit, preview, inline, live, and admin rendering modes.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>XP_COMPONENT_TYPE</code>, <code>XP_REQUEST_TYPE</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Normalized page-component kinds and fetch request kinds.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>FROM_XP_PARAM</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Name of the query parameter carrying the encrypted blob from XP: <code>xp</code>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>RENDER_MODE_HEADER</code>, <code>PROJECT_ID_HEADER</code>, <code>XP_BASE_URL_HEADER</code>, <code>JSESSIONID_HEADER</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">Header names used to pass rendering, project, and session context through the integration.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock"><code>PORTAL_COMPONENT_ATTRIBUTE</code>, <code>PORTAL_REGION_ATTRIBUTE</code></p></td>
<td class="tableblock halign-left valign-top"><p class="tableblock">DOM attributes used by Content Studio editing.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Prefer these exports to duplicated string values in application code.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
